# Pairs with ExpiredEventuallyPruned, under the fairness Spec asserts. A
# crashed pass leaves itself marked as running - as a persisted in-flight
# flag would - so no later pass starts and nothing is pruned again.
MODULE: ExpiredEventuallyPrunedCrashWedgesPass
TARGET: ExpiredEventuallyPruned
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a crash leaves the pass marked running
PERTURBS: PruneCrash

--- FIND
    /\ crashes' = crashes + 1
    /\ prPh' = [prPh EXCEPT ![p] = "idle"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ crashes' = crashes + 1
    \* MUTATION: the pass stays marked running.
    /\ prPh' = [prPh EXCEPT ![p] = "delete"]
--- END